"""Publishable arm visual/collision comparison with matched cameras."""
import json
from build import ROOT,OUT

def main():
    report=json.loads((OUT/'verification.json').read_text());renders=json.loads((OUT/'renders.json').read_text());views={}
    for row in renders['views']:
        views.setdefault(row['role'],{}).setdefault(row['scope'],{}).setdefault(row['camera'],{})[row['stage']]=row['path']
    data=dict(views=views,visualSaving=report['placed_visual_saved'],collisionSaving=report['placed_collision_saved'],
        collisionBefore=report['source_arm_collision_triangles_per_core']*2,collisionAfter=report['candidate_arm_collision_triangles_per_core']*2,
        nativeArmMesh=(report['candidate_arm_collision_triangles_per_core']-9*96)*2,
        fieldVisual=report['field_visual_triangles'],fieldCollision=report['field_collision_preview_triangles'])
    html='''<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><style>
body{font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui);color:var(--foreground);line-height:1.45}p{margin:0 0 12px}.muted,small{color:var(--muted-foreground)}.controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:14px 0}select{font:inherit;color:var(--foreground);background:var(--background);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px;padding:8px;max-width:100%}.pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.caption{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:5px}.imagebox{aspect-ratio:1;background:#c3d2e0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}.imagebox img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px;margin:14px 0}td,th{text-align:left;padding:8px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.note{padding:16px;margin:14px 0;background:var(--secondary);border-radius:var(--radius,10px)}.note p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}small{font-size:12px}
</style></head><body>
<p><strong>First Core arm pass: simpler tubes and four cylindrical joint colliders.</strong></p>
<p>The tube visuals retain their length, main taper, flared ends and openings. Joint visuals keep the installed shells; their collision can use solid cylinders.</p>
<div class="controls"><select id="role" aria-label="Geometry role"><option value="visual">Visual appearance</option><option value="collision">Collision shapes</option></select><select id="scope" aria-label="Part scope"><option value="arm">Complete arm</option><option value="whole-core">Whole Core</option><option value="upper-tube">Main flanged tube</option><option value="lower-tube">Second tube</option><option value="shoulder">Shoulder joint</option><option value="upper-joint">Upper joint</option><option value="elbow">Elbow joint</option><option value="wrist">Wrist joint</option></select><select id="camera" aria-label="Camera"><option value="oblique">Oblique</option><option value="reverse">Reverse</option></select><select id="reference" aria-label="Reference"><option value="installed">Installed reference</option><option value="step">Unsimplified STEP arm</option></select></div>
<div class="pair"><div><p class="caption" id="beforeLabel">Installed visual</p><div class="imagebox"><img id="before" alt="Reference Core arm geometry"></div></div><div><p class="caption" id="afterLabel">Proposed visual</p><div class="imagebox"><img id="after" alt="Simplified Core arm geometry"></div></div></div>
<p id="viewNote" class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:9px"></p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Across both Cores</th><th>Before</th><th>Candidate</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Arm collision mesh preview</td><td>46,182</td><td>23,138 <small>(−49.9%)</small></td></tr><tr><td>Native alternative</td><td>46,182 mesh triangles</td><td>21,410 mesh triangles + 18 cylinders</td></tr><tr><td>Two tube visuals</td><td>5,072 triangles</td><td>2,176 triangles</td></tr></tbody></table>
<div class="note"><p><strong>The main shapes stay in place.</strong> Tube profiles differ by at most 1.20 mm in finite samples against installed geometry. Sampled joint source points extend up to 3.75 mm outside the native cylinders.</p><p>Collision cylinders intentionally fill joint bores and access openings. They preserve separate source owners and transforms. Small attachments and the two more complex motor shells remain.</p></div>
<p><strong>Protected visuals:</strong> the entire tool head keeps exact geometry and materials. Neither matched whole-Core camera loses protected pixels. Existing jagged joint surfaces and gaps in the visual reference remain; this pass changes only the tubes visually.</p>
<p class="muted"><small>Whole-field review candidate, including the accepted Outpost pair and prior collision studies: 344,792 visual / 489,213 collision preview triangles. Native cylinders are an alternative to their preview triangles, counted once. No assets installed, motion/contact approval or speedup measurement. Views use identical cameras and diagnostic flat lighting; smooth radial tube normals are included in the visual GLB for runtime shading. STEP reference is available for the complete visual arm only.</small></p>
<script>const data=__DATA__,el=id=>document.getElementById(id);function show(){let role=el('role').value,scope=el('scope').value,cam=el('camera').value;let allow=role==='visual'&&scope==='arm';el('reference').disabled=!allow;let ref=allow?el('reference').value:'installed';let v=data.views[role][scope][cam];el('before').src=v[ref];el('after').src=v.candidate;el('beforeLabel').textContent=ref==='step'?'Unsimplified STEP-derived arm':'Installed '+role;el('afterLabel').textContent='Proposed '+role;el('viewNote').textContent=role==='collision'?'Blue: rebuilt collision surfaces. Grey: retained geometry. Cylinders shown as 24-segment diagnostics; native physics uses round shapes.':(['shoulder','upper-joint','elbow','wrist'].includes(scope)?'This joint visual is unchanged. Switch to collision shapes to inspect its simplified collider.':'Only the two long tube visuals change. Joint shells and the protected head remain as installed.');}['role','scope','camera','reference'].forEach(id=>el(id).onchange=show);show();console.log('Arm comparison ready: 66 verified matched images');</script>
</body></html>'''
    (OUT/'gallery.html').write_text(html.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(data)))

if __name__=='__main__':main()
